{558}{I find your very presence distasteful, to say the least.}{I find your very presence distasteful, to say the least.}{}{}{}{}
{559}{If I could only have a simple moment of your time...}{}{5}{}{568}{re45}
{560}{That feeling is mutual... But I have need of some information.}{}{5}{}{568}{}
{567}{If that is how you feel, I will be leaving, then.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{568}{Well... as long as you keep a civil tongue, I may deign to speak with you for a moment or two. What is it you want?}{Well... as long as you keep a civil tongue, I may deign to speak with you for a moment or two. What is it you want?}{}{}{}{}
{569}{May I ask you a question?}{}{5}{ss3}{27}{}
